        <headline>Flood Warning issued September 26 at 10:19AM EDT until September 26 at 8:15PM EDT by NWS Albany NY</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Minor flooding is forecast.

* WHERE...Hudson River near Poughkeepsie.

* WHEN...Until this evening.

* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...
- At 9:45 AM EDT Saturday the stage was 2.6 feet.
- Forecast...The river will oscillate around flood stage with a
maximum value of 4.7 feet this afternoon.
- Flood stage is 4.2 feet.
- Flood History...No available flood history.
- http://www.weather.gov/safety/flood
</description>
